{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Virtual buttons",
  "description": {
    "en": "Your own buttons, switches and timed switches, with an icon, to start your scenes.",
    "fr": "Vos propres boutons, interrupteurs et minuteries, avec une icône, pour lancer vos scènes."
  },
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/lm1lc3n7/gladys-virtual-buttons:0.1.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LM1LC3N7/gladys-virtual-buttons/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["services"],
  "transports": ["local"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Create your own buttons",
        "fr": "Créez vos propres boutons"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "1. Click \"Add a button\" below: a name, a type, an icon. 2. Open the Discovery tab and click \"Create\" next to the button. 3. Create a scene \"when the button changes to 1\" that does what you want. 4. Add the \"Buttons\" widget on your dashboard. The button does nothing by itself: the scene acts. Never use a switch for a sensitive command (gate, alarm, boiler): a \"turn everything off\", the voice or a scene can reach it; use a push button with confirmation. Tested with a fake Gladys only.",
        "fr": "1. Cliquez sur « Ajouter un bouton » ci-dessous : un nom, un type, une icône. 2. Ouvrez l'onglet Découverte et cliquez sur « Créer » à côté du bouton. 3. Créez une scène « quand le bouton passe à 1 » qui fait ce que vous voulez. 4. Ajoutez le widget « Boutons » sur votre tableau de bord. Le bouton ne fait rien tout seul : c'est la scène qui agit. N'utilisez jamais un interrupteur pour une commande sensible (portail, alarme, chaudière) : un « tout éteindre », la voix ou une scène peut l'atteindre ; prenez un bouton poussoir avec confirmation. Testé seulement avec un faux Gladys."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/LM1LC3N7/gladys-virtual-buttons/blob/main/docs/fr.md",
          "label": {
            "en": "Step-by-step guide (French)",
            "fr": "Guide pas à pas (français)"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/LM1LC3N7/gladys-virtual-buttons/blob/main/docs/en.md",
          "label": {
            "en": "Step-by-step guide (English)",
            "fr": "Guide pas à pas (anglais)"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "add_button",
      "label": {
        "en": "Add a button",
        "fr": "Ajouter un bouton"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Up to 100 buttons. Then create it in the Discovery tab.",
        "fr": "100 boutons au plus. Créez-le ensuite dans l'onglet Découverte."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 15,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Name",
            "fr": "Nom"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Up to 40 characters; the widget shows the first 24.",
            "fr": "40 caractères au plus ; le widget affiche les 24 premiers."
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Heating",
            "fr": "Chauffage"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "kind",
          "type": "select",
          "display": "radio",
          "label": {
            "en": "Type of button",
            "fr": "Type de bouton"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Cannot be changed later.",
            "fr": "Ne peut plus être changé ensuite."
          },
          "required": true,
          "default": "push",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "push",
              "label": {
                "en": "Push button: one press = one pulse, to start a scene",
                "fr": "Bouton poussoir : un appui = une impulsion, pour lancer une scène"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "switch",
              "label": {
                "en": "Switch: on / off, remembered",
                "fr": "Interrupteur : marche / arrêt, mémorisé"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "timed",
              "label": {
                "en": "Timed switch: goes back to off by itself after the duration below",
                "fr": "Interrupteur temporisé : revient seul à l'arrêt après la durée ci-dessous"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "minutes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Duration in minutes (timed switch only)",
            "fr": "Durée en minutes (interrupteur temporisé seulement)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "From 1 to 1440 (24 hours).",
            "fr": "De 1 à 1440 (24 heures)."
          },
          "required": false,
          "default": 30,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1440
        },
        {
          "key": "icon",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Icon",
            "fr": "Icône"
          },
          "required": false,
          "default": "power",
          "options": [
            { "value": "power", "label": { "en": "On / off", "fr": "Marche / arrêt" } },
            { "value": "flame", "label": { "en": "Flame / heating", "fr": "Flamme / chauffage" } },
            { "value": "thermometer", "label": { "en": "Thermometer", "fr": "Thermomètre" } },
            { "value": "lightbulb", "label": { "en": "Light bulb", "fr": "Ampoule" } },
            { "value": "blinds", "label": { "en": "Shutter", "fr": "Volet" } },
            { "value": "plug", "label": { "en": "Plug", "fr": "Prise" } },
            { "value": "fan", "label": { "en": "Fan", "fr": "Ventilateur" } },
            { "value": "music", "label": { "en": "Music", "fr": "Musique" } },
            { "value": "film", "label": { "en": "Movie", "fr": "Film" } },
            { "value": "tv", "label": { "en": "Television", "fr": "Télévision" } },
            { "value": "door-open", "label": { "en": "Door", "fr": "Porte" } },
            { "value": "home", "label": { "en": "House", "fr": "Maison" } },
            { "value": "moon", "label": { "en": "Moon / night", "fr": "Lune / nuit" } },
            { "value": "sun", "label": { "en": "Sun / day", "fr": "Soleil / jour" } },
            { "value": "bell", "label": { "en": "Alarm / bell", "fr": "Alarme / sonnette" } },
            { "value": "star", "label": { "en": "Star", "fr": "Étoile" } },
            { "value": "droplet", "label": { "en": "Water", "fr": "Eau" } },
            { "value": "coffee", "label": { "en": "Coffee", "fr": "Café" } },
            { "value": "zap", "label": { "en": "Lightning", "fr": "Éclair" } },
            { "value": "timer", "label": { "en": "Timer", "fr": "Minuteur" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "style",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Colour in the widget",
            "fr": "Couleur dans le widget"
          },
          "required": false,
          "default": "primary",
          "options": [
            { "value": "primary", "label": { "en": "Main (blue)", "fr": "Principal (bleu)" } },
            {
              "value": "secondary",
              "label": { "en": "Secondary (grey)", "fr": "Secondaire (gris)" }
            },
            { "value": "danger", "label": { "en": "Danger (red)", "fr": "Danger (rouge)" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "confirm",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Ask for confirmation before pressing (widget)",
            "fr": "Demander une confirmation avant l'appui (widget)"
          },
          "required": false,
          "default": "no",
          "options": [
            { "value": "no", "label": { "en": "No", "fr": "Non" } },
            { "value": "yes", "label": { "en": "Yes", "fr": "Oui" } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "edit_button",
      "label": {
        "en": "Change a button",
        "fr": "Modifier un bouton"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Only the fields you fill in change. The type cannot change.",
        "fr": "Seuls les champs remplis changent. Le type ne change pas."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 15,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "button",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Button",
            "fr": "Bouton"
          },
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "key": "current_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Or its current name (button not created yet)",
            "fr": "Ou son nom actuel (bouton pas encore créé)"
          },
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "key": "name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "New name in the widget",
            "fr": "Nouveau nom dans le widget"
          },
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "key": "minutes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "New duration in minutes (timed switch)",
            "fr": "Nouvelle durée en minutes (interrupteur temporisé)"
          },
          "required": false,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1440
        },
        {
          "key": "icon",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "New icon",
            "fr": "Nouvelle icône"
          },
          "required": false,
          "options": [
            { "value": "power", "label": { "en": "On / off", "fr": "Marche / arrêt" } },
            { "value": "flame", "label": { "en": "Flame / heating", "fr": "Flamme / chauffage" } },
            { "value": "thermometer", "label": { "en": "Thermometer", "fr": "Thermomètre" } },
            { "value": "lightbulb", "label": { "en": "Light bulb", "fr": "Ampoule" } },
            { "value": "blinds", "label": { "en": "Shutter", "fr": "Volet" } },
            { "value": "plug", "label": { "en": "Plug", "fr": "Prise" } },
            { "value": "fan", "label": { "en": "Fan", "fr": "Ventilateur" } },
            { "value": "music", "label": { "en": "Music", "fr": "Musique" } },
            { "value": "film", "label": { "en": "Movie", "fr": "Film" } },
            { "value": "tv", "label": { "en": "Television", "fr": "Télévision" } },
            { "value": "door-open", "label": { "en": "Door", "fr": "Porte" } },
            { "value": "home", "label": { "en": "House", "fr": "Maison" } },
            { "value": "moon", "label": { "en": "Moon / night", "fr": "Lune / nuit" } },
            { "value": "sun", "label": { "en": "Sun / day", "fr": "Soleil / jour" } },
            { "value": "bell", "label": { "en": "Alarm / bell", "fr": "Alarme / sonnette" } },
            { "value": "star", "label": { "en": "Star", "fr": "Étoile" } },
            { "value": "droplet", "label": { "en": "Water", "fr": "Eau" } },
            { "value": "coffee", "label": { "en": "Coffee", "fr": "Café" } },
            { "value": "zap", "label": { "en": "Lightning", "fr": "Éclair" } },
            { "value": "timer", "label": { "en": "Timer", "fr": "Minuteur" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "style",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "New colour in the widget",
            "fr": "Nouvelle couleur dans le widget"
          },
          "required": false,
          "options": [
            { "value": "primary", "label": { "en": "Main (blue)", "fr": "Principal (bleu)" } },
            {
              "value": "secondary",
              "label": { "en": "Secondary (grey)", "fr": "Secondaire (gris)" }
            },
            { "value": "danger", "label": { "en": "Danger (red)", "fr": "Danger (rouge)" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "confirm",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Confirmation before pressing (widget)",
            "fr": "Confirmation avant l'appui (widget)"
          },
          "required": false,
          "options": [
            { "value": "no", "label": { "en": "No", "fr": "Non" } },
            { "value": "yes", "label": { "en": "Yes", "fr": "Oui" } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "remove_button",
      "label": {
        "en": "Remove a button",
        "fr": "Supprimer un bouton"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Then delete its device in the Devices tab if you had created it.",
        "fr": "Supprimez ensuite son appareil dans l'onglet Appareils si vous l'aviez créé."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 15,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "button",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Button",
            "fr": "Bouton"
          },
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "key": "current_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Or its name (button not created yet)",
            "fr": "Ou son nom (bouton pas encore créé)"
          },
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "key": "buttons",
      "label": {
        "en": "Buttons",
        "fr": "Boutons"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Up to 4 of your virtual buttons, with their icon and colour.",
        "fr": "Jusqu'à 4 de vos boutons virtuels, avec leur icône et leur couleur."
      },
      "icon": "toggle-right",
      "action_timeout_seconds": 10,
      "settings": [
        {
          "key": "button_1",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Button 1",
            "fr": "Bouton 1"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "button_2",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Button 2",
            "fr": "Bouton 2"
          },
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "key": "button_3",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Button 3",
            "fr": "Bouton 3"
          },
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "key": "button_4",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Button 4",
            "fr": "Bouton 4"
          },
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
